  "body": "Initial public release for the bidirectional gut microbiome–erectile dysfunction Mendelian-randomization study.\r\n\r\nIncludes:\r\n- frozen analysis code and provenance receipts;\r\n- complete forward and reverse summary results;\r\n- IJIR manuscript, title page, cover letter, and STROBE-MR checklist;\r\n- editable main tables, supplementary data, and 600-dpi figures.\r\n\r\nEvidence boundary: no association survived direction-specific false-discovery-rate control, and this release does not support a positive causal claim. Third-party GWAS payloads are not redistributed.\r\n\r\nArchived record:\r\n- Version DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21456671\r\n- All-version concept DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21456670"
